# Description: ZealLab AutoDev - schedule AI agents to keep developing your projects.
# Installation: /usr/lib/zl/autodev
#
# Thin shim invoked by the 'zl' dispatcher as `zl autodev [args]`. The program is
# a self-contained binary installed by this package; nothing is placed on $PATH.
# Cron jobs created by the dashboard call the binary by its full path.
